WEBVTT

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:04.570
<i>El Amdalt Li Els Di Amlsia.</i>

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:36.320
That was the first time in my life I'd ever seen magic in person.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:43.170
The magical light was so pretty... So gentle...

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:49.890
It was more than enough to make me long to become a mage.

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:26.140
<i>Haruhi, it's coming!</i>

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:27.270
I know!

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.660
<i>El Amstia.</i>

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.210
Amazing.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:07.770
She can use such complicated defensive magic.

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:12.910
They say she's the greatest genius since the Mizuhosaka Academy's School of Magic was founded.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:16.110
She's the only class B in first year.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.830
Wonderful, Kamisaka-san.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.850
That's all for our magic practice today.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:32.720
Haruhi, that wasn't bad.

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:38.350
But next time I'll show you an even more impressive spell.  Look forward to it.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:40.950
That is, if Paella and I get serious...

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:45.730
<i>Anri-sama, don't forget your dear Paella!</i>

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.290
I know!

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.380
I didn't really forget you.

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:56.360
I was just thinking that you'd want some private time once in a while...

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:11.510
There sure are a lot of cute girls in the School of Magic.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:13.950
Don't you think so, Jun?  Yuuma?

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:17.280
Then why don't you join the School of Magic, Hachi?

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:21.430
You know, Jun, if I had any kind of magical talent I definitely would.

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:25.930
Maybe the Magic School building will just explode all of a sudden,

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:29.700
and they'll all have to transfer here...

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:30.840
Sure, sure...

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:37.300
Magic, huh?

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:43.520
<b>Valentine</b>

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:25.560
Going out, Haruhi?

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.580
Yeah, just for a bit.

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:33.020
I bet it's for Valentine's chocolate, isn't it?

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:37.600
You're going to toss out chocolate to all the guys and secure your current popularity, aren't you?

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:39.510
I wasn't going to just toss it out...

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:40.670
Just wait here.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.510
I'm going, too.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.710
Jeez, Anri-chan...

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.620
Why's it so crowded?

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.190
Because it's the last Sunday before Valentine's Day.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:09.730
Look.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:11.570
Hey, that girl there...

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.960
Isn't that too heavy for you, miss?

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:16.670
I'm fine, Tama-chan.

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:20.620
Anri-chan, could that be...?

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.100
Koyuki-senpai!

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:25.250
Good afternoon, Takamine-senpai...

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.450
Oh, Kamisaka-san...

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:31.940
Hi... hi... hiiielp... I don't know your name?

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:37.630
Hiiragi Anri.  At least you made an effort to remember it.

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:40.940
So, who is all this chocolate a present for?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:43.400
Do you have to give it to someone?

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.400
You see, lately...

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:51.360
Senpai, please use your fortune telling to tell me what kind of chocolate will make the best present this Valentine's Day.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:54.600
I'm getting a lot of requests like that.

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:58.350
But, I don't really know much about the different types of chocolate, and so...

00:07:58.350 --> 00:08:00.650
So you actually came to buy some.

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:03.970
By the way, I want to ask you two something.

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:09.090
What's the connection between St. Valentine's Day and chocolate?

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:22.970
Isn't this enough, Jun?

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.600
That's for the class.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.180
Now I need some for my fan club.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:28.600
And I want to give some sweetheart chocolate to Yuuma, too!

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:31.100
I'll be hanging around at the park.

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:33.140
Aw, he's so shy.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:36.070
Uhm, you still haven't decided?

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:37.800
I figured if I'm going to buy some,

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:42.270
I should by some that's nicer than yours so I can steal your popularity!

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.580
That's not really what I'm after...

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.190
Well, I'm going to get some fresh air.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:05.440
Stop it!

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.320
Stop it, give that back to me!

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.160
I'll give it back if you say who you were going to give it to.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.830
Give it back!

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.130
Takashi, pass!

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:15.980
All right!

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:17.280
Give it back!

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:19.450
Takashi, back to you!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.070
Give it back, give it back!

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:24.670
Stop it.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.520
Give it back.

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:38.720
Only losers tease girls, you know?

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.970
Th-This is none of your business!

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:44.560
No, as a fellow man, I can't ignore this.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:45.660
Forget this!

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:49.940
Let's go, guys.

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:59.370
Hey, would you loan that to me for a second?

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:01.310
OK?

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.490
Soprano, ready?

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:11.630
<i><i>Yes, Haruhi.</i></i>

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:19.550
<i>El Amdalt Li Els.</i>

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.870
<i>Di Amunmalsas!</i>

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:31.270
Magic?

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:37.190
Miss, are you a mage?

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:39.140
I'm still a student trainee...

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:39.880
Here you go.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:52.810
Thank you!

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:55.710
Are you giving it to a boy you like?

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.960
I hope you can give it to him!

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:58.720
Yeah!

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.560
Thanks, miss!

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:06.920
I really hope you can give it to him...

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:17.990
U-Uhm...

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:21.120
There you are!

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:22.970
Yuuma!

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.580
See you.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:38.640
Even if Kamisaka-san is a hottie, you can't cheat on me, Yuuma!

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:42.900
You know, Jun, this isn't the first time I've said this, but...

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:46.200
I am not your damn boyfriend!

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:50.280
Not to mention you are 100% male, damn it!

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:52.930
Why the hell do you dress like that?!

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:58.580
I look so much better in girls' clothes!

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.170
I just can't help it.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:03.400
That's not the issue here.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:08.090
Kamisaka-san?  That girl... You know her, Jun?

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:10.230
What are you talking about?

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:15.390
She's the idol of the Mizuhosaka Academy School of Magic's first year class, Kamisaka Haruhi-chan!

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:21.510
I see.  So she's the girl from the School of Magic that everybody's talking about.

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:38.000
I thought it was him for a minute...

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:39.920
Give it back.

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:57.090
Maybe this year I'll find him.

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:08.900
Here, Brother.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.830
Valentine's chocolate.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.610
Ah, Sumomo-chan, don't try getting to him first!

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.520
Here's some from your mom!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.250
I don't really need any right now...

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:19.870
Here!

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:03.030
Morning, "Brother."

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:04.090
Brother?

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:08.230
You got Valentine's chocolate from Sumomo-chan, didn't you?

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:09.920
No.

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:12.440
You're kidding...

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:16.410
I really don't have any...

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:17.640
Show me!

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:19.840
Show me the chocolate!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:19.840
I said I don't have any!

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:23.520
I told you I'd give you chocolate.

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:25.580
I did during middle school, didn't I?

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:28.880
I don't need chocolate from a man!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:29.880
I'd rather die!

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:34.820
This year!  This year shall be the year I get chocolate from a young girl!

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:36.030
So?

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:37.260
Who are you giving it to?

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.220
Come on, confess!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.750
Who are you giving that chocolate to?

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.500
It doesn't matter, does it?

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.490
That's not good enough!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:50.470
Who you give your chocolate to will decide the ultimate fate of my chocolate!

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.720
But, still...

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:54.870
You've got a card to go with it, didn't you?

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:55.970
Show it to me!

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:57.990
Time to go home now.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:02.430
It doesn't seem I'll be able to give it to him this year either...

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:07.230
All right then, I'll just have to force you to show it to me.

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:09.940
Fortunately, nobody else is around.

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:12.880
Hold on, Anri-chan.  You're not seriously...

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:14.200
Paella.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:15.620
<i><i>Yes, Anri-sama.</i></i>

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:18.570
<i>On Almesas Alsas!</i>

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:23.150
<i>Estalias Auk Elutora!</i>

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:26.000
You're using offensive magic without a field?

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.220
It's too dangerous!

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:28.510
I'm good!

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:32.940
I'll be in class B soon.  I can control this.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.610
Just a little longer...

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:46.360
If I just wait a little longer and I'm sure some wonderful girl will come running up with chocolate...

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:48.630
Let's just go home, Hachi.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:52.640
I thought I'd at least get one.

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:54.850
There's still next year, Hachi.

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:57.850
I told you I'd give you some...

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:05.940
Soprano!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:06.690
<i><i>Right!</i></i>

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.630
Anri-chan, come on...

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:11.020
We're not done yet.

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:21.700
You're losing control of it!

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.850
What the heck was that?!

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:31.610
Magic?

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.550
Are you OK?!

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:39.930
Yeah, I guess...

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:43.290
You're the one I saw on Sunday...

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.470
You're hurt.

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:47.850
I'm all right.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.860
It was no big deal.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.040
I'm sorry.

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:56.760
No, it's our fault...

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:00.930
Here you go.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:13.950
Uhm...

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.990
If it's OK, would you take this?

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.520
But this is Valentine's chocolate...

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:26.790
No... I just bought it without anybody special to give it to.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.590
Take it.

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:37.200
Thank you.

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:43.070
I see.

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:45.250
That's who you're after, Haruhi.

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:47.800
Sorry about that.

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:50.730
I'm Hiiragi Anri from the School of Magic's first year class.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:52.710
Nice to meet you.

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:53.700
Hi.

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:56.960
Goodbye then...

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:09.690
Damn it!  Yuuma, I hate you!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:13.160
You got two boxes of chocolate from pretty girls in the magic school...

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.610
I wish it had hit me.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.190
Oh, my.

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:21.110
Hey, where'd you meet them?

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:23.210
It's not that...

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:24.180
What's his name?

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.120
Birthday?

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:26.430
Blood type?

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:28.350
I'll tell you if you're compatible.

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:31.500
Come to think of it, I didn't ask his name.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:32.390
Really?

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:36.130
The regular classes and School of Magic's classes don't really get many chances to meet.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.210
I messed up.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:40.530
If the School of Magic's building suddenly blew up,

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:44.150
and everybody transferred to the regular school, you'd be able to find his name right away.

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:46.440
That's slightly terrifying, coming from you.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:03.880
Was she his girlfriend?  If she was, I did something bad.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:04.750
Here you go.

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:28.460
<i>El Amdalt Li Els.</i>

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:22.810
Brother, Brother!

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:23.850
It's awful!

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.700
Come right away!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.320
By the time the fire department arrived,

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:33.990
SIGN:  Mysterious explosion rocks Academy building last night!

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:34.010
the flames had almost completely receded, and they are investigating the cause of the accident.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.920
They say it was a gas explosion.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:38.680
The cause of the explosion remains unknown.  Fortunately, no students or staff were hurt...

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.690
What will happen with our classes?

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.350
Well...

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:44.610
They say they're closing the school for a while.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.170
Instead they're advancing next year's start.

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:50.550
For the time being, the School of Magic students will have classes with the regular students.

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:51.690
Including the new students?

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:55.080
The new students will be part of the mixed class, too.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:56.370
Amazing!

00:20:56.370 --> 00:21:00.500
We'll be studying with mage apprentices!

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:02.990
I see...

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:06.010
I wonder what class she'll join.

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:13.980
I wonder if I'll be in his class.

00:21:27.190 --> 00:21:30.740
I didn't really think we'd be transfered to the regular school...

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:32.570
You're happy, aren't you, Haruhi?

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:36.040
That wasn't you who blew up the building, was it?

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:38.520
No, no!  It wasn't me!

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.190
Ah, this is our class!

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:45.940
What kind of girls will be coming, do you think?

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:47.120
What kind?

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:51.040
We'll only be together for one semester.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:53.870
You really want Haruhi-chan to come here though!

00:23:55.080 --> 00:24:25.040
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:55.640 --> 00:23:57.340
N-Nice to meet you!

00:23:57.340 --> 00:23:58.670
I'm Kamisaka Haruhi.

00:23:58.670 --> 00:24:02.340
You've already met me, so this isn't our first meeting.

00:24:02.340 --> 00:24:03.530
So, once again...

00:24:03.530 --> 00:24:05.620
Hello, I'm Kamisaka Haruhi.

00:24:05.620 --> 00:24:08.160
I'm a first year student in the Mizuhosaka Academy School of Magic.

00:24:08.160 --> 00:24:11.960
But when the next episode starts I'll be a second year student.

00:24:11.960 --> 00:24:15.520
And it looks like my class will be with the regular students.

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:19.060
Uhm... Anyway, the point is...

00:24:19.060 --> 00:24:21.950
The next episode is:  Flower Viewing.

00:24:19.800 --> 00:24:25.040
<b>Flower Viewing</b>

00:24:21.950 --> 00:24:25.030
Did I say it right?
